# Compression Layer side-channel (v2.14 Fase 2, PATTERN §20.10 + R.G6)
# Knowledge graph estratto da graphify-sync — view derivata, mai authoritative
# (filesystem = single source of truth, R.G1). Rebuildable da <code_path>.
.graphify-state/

# Node / build (L5 packages/app)
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Playwright
packages/app/playwright-report/
packages/app/test-results/

# Visual Oracle (v2.17) — runner Bash/JS generati (rebuildable) + cartelle screenshot PNG.
# I report .json/.md restano versionati; solo i binari PNG e i runner sono ignorati.
.factory-runners/
code_quality/reports/*-visual-iter-*/
code_quality/reports/*-visual-baseline/

# ROM di test: niente binari nel repo (copyright). Solo il README è tracciato.
# Per abilitare una ROM LIBERA all'e2e, whitelistarla esplicitamente con:
#   !packages/app/public/test-roms/<nome-rom-libera>
packages/app/public/test-roms/*
!packages/app/public/test-roms/README.md
!packages/app/public/test-roms/dmg-acid2.gb
!packages/app/public/test-roms/gba-tests-thumb.gba

.vercel

# EP-013 analytics events side-channel (ADR-021 §A) — gitignored
analytics/events/
analytics/reports/
.factory-upgrade-backup/
